<br>
<b>Notice of Public Meeting</b><br>
Cherokee County will hold a public meeting on Friday, October 16, 2026,<br>to gather public input to update the <b>County's Hazard Mitigation Plan</b>.<br>The meeting is from 11AM to 12PM at the Cherokee County Courthouse Annex.<br> 
<a target="_blank" href="notices/Hazard Mitigation Meeting 10-16-26.pdf"><font size="3">More Info</font></a><font size="2"> (PDF)</font>
<hr width="80%">


