<p align="center">
<font size="3"><b>Public Survey for Hazard Mitigation Action Plan</b></font><br>
Cherokee County is gathering public input to update the County's<br>Hazard Mitigation Plan. To start this survey, please scan<br>the QR Code shown below or click this link:<br><a target="_blank" href="https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/YRRHTCC"><font size="3">Public Risk Assessment Survey</font></a>
<br><a target="_blank" href="https://www.surveymonkey.com/r/YRRHTCC"><img border="0" alt="QR Code for Public Risk Assessment Survey" width="164" height="164" src="othercountyoffices/emc-docs/Cherke.Co.HMAP Risk Survey_QR_code.png"></a>
</p>
<hr width="80%">
<p><br><br><br><span style="font-weight: bold"><a href="https://www.smart911.com/smart911/ref/reg.action?pa=cherokeecountytexas" target="_blank"><img border="0" alt="CODERED_image" width="500" height="128" src="rave-alert.png" /></a></span>
</br>
<!--
As of February 15, 2020 the East Texas Council of Governments will transfer<br>Cherokee County reverse 911 Emergency Notification System to Rave Alert.<br>All residents of Cherokee County who previously registered with Code Red to receive Emergency Notifications will be required to re-register as the information previously provided to Code Red will not transfer over.</br>
-->
</br>
Please visit <a href="https://www.smart911.com/smart911/ref/reg.action?pa=cherokeecountytexas" target="_blank">Smart911</a> to input the information required.</br>
</br> 
If you should have any questions or need any assistance<br>please contact your <a href="http://co.cherokee.tx.us/ips/cms/othercountyoffices/emergencyManagement.html">Cherokee County Emergency Management Coordinators</a>

</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><font size="1">Design by the <a title="County Information Resources Agency" target="_blank" href="http://www.cira.state.tx.us/">County Information Resources Agency</a>&nbsp;<br />
</font><font size="1">of the <a title="Texas Association of Counties" target="_blank" href="http://www.county.org/">Texas Association of Counties</a> </font></p>
